            "expand_by_default": false,
            "column_placement": "right",
            "heading": "ingredients",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "content": "<p><strong>Keratin treatment</strong></p><p>aqua (water/eau), glyoxylic acid, glyoxyloyl keratin amino acids, glyoxyloyl carbocysteine, propylene glycol, parfum (fragrance), sodium hydroxide, vinegar, vitis vinifera (grape) fruit extract, behentrimonium chloride, cetearyl alcohol, myristyl alcohol, cetrimonium chloride, tetrasodium glutamate diacetate, fructose, glucose, gluconic acid, gluconolactone, hexyl cinnamal, styrax benzoin resin extract, ananas sativus (pineapple) fruit extract, commiphora myrrha (myrrh) resin extract, etidronic acid, caesalpinia spinosa (tara) gum, myroxylon balsamum (balsam tolu) resin, ci 16035 (red 40), ci 19140 (yellow 5).</p><p><strong>Shampoo</strong></p><p>aqua (water), potassium laureth-4 carboxylate, sorbitan oleate decylglucoside crosspolymer, cocamidopropyl hydroxysultaine, maris sal (sea salt), polyquaternium-22, sodium benzoate, parfum (fragrance), citric acid, potassium sorbate, ananas sativus (pineapple) fruit extract, sodium pca, tetrasodium glutamate diacetate, ci 16035 (red 40), ci 19140 (yellow 5).</p><p><strong>Conditioner</strong></p><p>aqua (water), cetearyl alcohol, cetyl alcohol, stearamidopropyl dimethylamine, cetrimonium chloride, phenoxyethanol, citric acid, parfum (fragrance), potassium sorbate, ananas sativus (pineapple) fruit extract, glycerin, ethylhexylglycerin, tetrasodium glutamate diacetate, helianthus annuus (sunflower) seed extract, decyl glucoside, ci 16035 (red 40), ci 19140 (yellow 5).</p>",
