          }
        },
        "3b30f82a-3e21-42c6-82df-6f3144df95fe": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Forget the frizz and say hello to smoothness and shine. Our keratin treatment delivers salon-level results at home in just a few easy steps at a fraction of the salon price. The groundbreaking formula is the first of its kind: vegan, clean, and giving results beyond the first wash. Whether you're taming frizz or making curls shiny and manageable, this treatment gives you a sleek look that lasts for three months, all without chemical damage enabled by its ultra-gentle formula.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "template--16155228307619__68f21f02-4e27-439d-8c2d-230d9b48ebc5-167533762479399dd1-0",
