    "158b7518-69cc-4904-8f88-ff62e49064b5": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "6994dc0d-2024-496c-9216-d9d4c5669ffd": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "The Shampoo and Conditioner That Extend Your Results",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-1-base"
          }
        },
        "186d1832-849a-47b1-82c5-cbc7071cd3ae": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "41cfa4d0-11a9-4288-86c9-a7bb2b4d6ac0": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The sulfate-free shampoo and conditioner duo, specially formulated to prolong the results of your keratin treatment - protects your hair while enhancing the smoothness and shine you love. Free from drying sulfates yet rich in luxurious lather, it leaves your hair feeling fresher  and smooth for longer. Infused with powerful AHAs and Phyto-ceramides for added strength and moisture, plus the irresistible scent of tropical pineapple to elevate your hair care routine.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        }
      },
